  "Los puntos se calculan automaticamente segun tus acciones dentro de GlitchGang: completar el perfil, conectar cuentas, jugar, publicar y competir.": "Points are calculated automatically based on your actions within GlitchGang: completing your profile, connecting accounts, playing, posting, and competing.",
